<file path="docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md">
# Accessibility

Use semantic landmarks, visible keyboard focus, labelled inputs, Radix dialogs and accordions, and reduced-motion styling. The account and checkout forms have explicit errors and status feedback. A WCAG 2.2 AA audit with screen readers and automated tools remains outstanding; do not claim formal conformance.
</file>

<file path="docs/AGENT-SKILLS.md">
# Agent skills

The project initially contained no project-local `SKILL.md` or `AGENTS.md`. The host `find-skills` and `skill-installer` instructions were reviewed. Skills.sh and each source `SKILL.md` were inspected before installation.

Project-scoped copies for Codex:

