The storefront uses warm neutral surfaces, semantic CSS variables, Geist typography, and consistent component primitives under `components/ui/`. Light and dark palettes are defined in `app/globals.css`. Navigation uses a restrained translucent surface. Motion and transparency preferences are respected in global styles. Additional page-level visual audits remain necessary.
